SUMMARY:GitHub automation & AI repo management
DESCRIPTION:Using github and copilot AI to manage\, automate and publish yo
 ur repository. We will show a demo where we create a Github repository wit
 h:\n\n  - automated test of the code\n  - automated workflow for publishin
 g as a webpage\n  - version upgrade for packages\n  - container publicatio
 n\n  - secret variables.\n\nAll this also through the help of Github copil
 ot\, which can create automations in the repositories very effectively. Fi
 nally\, we will show how to manage version control in a project on genomeD
 K computing cluster.\n\nCake and drinks provided! Share the invitation wit
 h your colleagues - please sign up only if you intend to actually particip
 ate 😊\n\nSign up: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfwMmIgA0U-K
 WAzhZ-LRosjbSQnW76yjjAChGCgaL7HVRoOxg/viewform?usp=header
LOCATION:Room 1632-212\, AIAS\, main campus
CATEGORIES:Workshop,GitHub,Copilot,GenomeDK
URL:https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfwMmIgA0U-KWAzhZ-LRosjbSQnW76
 yjjAChGCgaL7HVRoOxg/viewform?usp=header
END:VEVENT
