SUMMARY:AI tools and frameworks in bioinformatics
DESCRIPTION:Diana Sharysh\, postdoc at DREAM Lab at AU Biomedicine\, will t
 alk about AI tools and frameworks after having extensive experience speedi
 ng up development and coding.\nShe will touch topics such as\n  - Setting 
 up Claude code\, when and how to use it\n  -Knowledge databases and scalin
 g up research\n  - "Hygiene" practices for genomedk\n  - Tools like biomni
  for non-coders\n  - Making the framework more comprehensive\, creating "b
 locks of work"\n  - AI scientist: hyped but interesting\n\nAll of this fol
 lowed by discussion and your own suggestions and experiences! \n\nCake and
  drinks provided! Share the invitation with your colleagues - please sign 
 up only if you intend to actually participate 😊\n\nSign up: https://doc
 s.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfYF5_SfHh12aXNslJDm65X4jIfpF6tykVJiWDS5TYCg
 iTDng/viewform?usp=publish-editor
LOCATION:Room 1630-301\, AIAS\, main campus
CATEGORIES:Talk,Agents,Non-coders,GenomeDK
URL:https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfYF5_SfHh12aXNslJDm65X4jIfpF6
 tykVJiWDS5TYCgiTDng/viewform?usp=publish-editor
