SUMMARY:The role of knowledge in high level cognition: perspectives from hu
 mans and AI
DESCRIPTION:Abstract coming soon\n\n\nDr. Yoed Kenett is an Associate Profe
 ssor at the Faculty of Data and Decision Sciences at the Technion – Isra
 el Institute of Technology.\n\nDuring the academic year of 2026-2027 he is
  on Sabbatical at the Department of Management and AIAS at Aarhus Universi
 ty. His research computationally and empirically investigates the role of 
 knowledge in high-level cognition\, focusing on creativity\, associative t
 hinking\, memory search\, and question asking\, in typical and atypical po
 pulations.\n\nTo investigate these issues\, he applies computational tools
  from network science\, natural language processing\, and machine learning
 \, coupled with empirical cognitive and neural research. Prof. Kenett is t
 he Research Director in the Executive Committee of the Society for the Neu
 roscience of Creativity\, has won the 2021 Berlyne award for excellent res
 earch by a junior scientist\, and in 2025 was recognized as a rising star 
 in creativity research by the European ISSCI.\n\nSign up: https://forms.gl
 e/AySHTX5M46LBp2VK9
LOCATION:Room TBA\, AIAS\, main campus
CATEGORIES:Talk,network science,natural language processing,machine learnin
 g
URL:https://forms.gle/AySHTX5M46LBp2VK9
END:VEVENT
