SUMMARY:Scientific talk by Beck Strohmer
DESCRIPTION:Abstract and title coming soon\n\n\nBeck Strohmer\, PhD is a co
 mputational neuroscientist building spiking neural networks to study the b
 reakdown in locomotion during neurodegenerative disease.\n\nBeck holds an 
 MSc in Electrical Engineering and a PhD in Neuromorphic Engineering and ha
 s developed their research direction exploring the underlying mechanisms o
 f locomotor deficits over their postdoctoral positions.\n\nSign up: https:
 //forms.gle/BA73MtNZKMz8iA9J8
LOCATION:Room TBA\, AIAS\, main campus
CATEGORIES:Talk,computational neuroscience
URL:https://forms.gle/BA73MtNZKMz8iA9J8
END:VEVENT
