SUMMARY:Learning from Neural Signals: Signal Decomposition and Self-Supervi
 sed Learning
DESCRIPTION:Abstract and title coming soon\n\n\nNaveed ur Rehman is associa
 te professor at Aarhus University\, where their research focuses on signal
  processing and graph signal processing. Their related work includes Multi
 variate Variational Mode Decomposition and research on adaptive time-frequ
 ency analysis of multivariate signals. Before their current role\, they we
 re an assistant professor at Aarhus University and COMSATS Institute of In
 formation Technology. They pursued a PhD in electrical engineering at Impe
 rial College London.\n\nSign up: https://forms.gle/Y14MPHDYcNBXTxbJ9
LOCATION:1632-201\, AIAS\, main campus
CATEGORIES:Talk,neural signals
URL:https://forms.gle/Y14MPHDYcNBXTxbJ9
